Central Electricity Regulatory Commission (Power System Development Fund) Regulations, 201...
"Reactive Energy Charges" has the same meaning as assigned to it in the Grid Code;
(2)
Save as aforesaid and unless repugnant to the context or the subject-matter otherwise requires, words and expressions
used in these regulations and not defined, but defined in the Act, or the regulations made thereunder by the
Commission, shall have the meanings assigned to them respectively in the Act or the regulations.
(3)
Reference to any Act, Rules, Regulations or Guidelines shall include amendments or consolidation or reenactment
thereof.
